OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of 
OL,6,Frain continuing into the night, heavy  
OL,7,Fat times for south Aberdeenshire,      
OL,8,Fperhaps drier by dawn for Aberdeen.    
OL,9,FFresh southeatesterly winds gradually  
OL,10,Feasing down..                          
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter 
OL,13,Frain on Wednesday morning, rain        
OL,14,Fturning patchy through the afternoon   
OL,15,Fand evening.                           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
